---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="MCP — Fathom Research">
  <main class="mcp-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="mcp-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="mcpPage.hero.badge">MCP</p>
        <h1 class="h2-sec" data-i18n="mcpPage.hero.title">Both sides of the protocol.</h1>
        <p class="copy-lg mx-auto" data-i18n="mcpPage.hero.sub">Fathom Research speaks Model Context Protocol in both directions: it consumes tools from external MCP servers and exposes all of its own tools to external MCP clients.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feat">
        <div class="feat-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="mcpPage.client.badge">Client</p>
          <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="mcpPage.client.title">Consume any MCP server</h2>
          <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n="mcpPage.client.sub">stdio and Streamable HTTP transports, OAuth client-credentials, dynamic tool discovery and automatic reconnect. Tools of connected MCP servers become first-class agent tools — no code changes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="code-card">
          <pre><code># research.toml
[[mcp.servers]]
name = "postgres"
transport = "stdio"
command = "npx"
args = ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-postgres"]

[[mcp.servers]]
name = "remote"
transport = "http"
url = "https://mcp.example.com"
oauth = "client-credentials"</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat feat-reverse">
        <div class="feat-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="mcpPage.server.badge">Server</p>
          <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="mcpPage.server.title">Expose the whole toolbox</h2>
          <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n-html data-i18n="mcpPage.server.sub"><code class="ic">parallel-research mcp-serve</code> exposes all 50+ built-in tools over MCP and actually executes <code class="ic">tools/call</code> — any MCP client can drive real web search, contact extraction, memory and browser automation through Fathom.</p>
          <div class="more-links">
            <a href="/tools" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="mcpPage.server.browse">Browse the tools</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="code-card">
          <pre><code>parallel-research mcp-serve --transport stdio

# tools/list → web_search, extract_contacts,
#   memory_search, browser_navigate, …
# tools/call → real execution, real results</code></pre>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="api-grid">
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name" data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.transports.name">Transports</div><p data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.transports.d">stdio for local servers, Streamable HTTP for remote — both client and server side.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name" data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.oauth.name">OAuth</div><p data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.oauth.d">client-credentials flow handled automatically for authenticated HTTP servers.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name" data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.discovery.name">Discovery</div><p data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.discovery.d">Tools are discovered dynamically at startup and after reconnects.</p></div>
        <div class="api-card"><div class="api-name" data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.reconnect.name">Reconnect</div><p data-i18n="mcpPage.cards.reconnect.d">Dropped stdio/HTTP servers are reconnected without restarting the agent.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .mcp-page { padding: 70px 0 90px; }
  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grey-600); }
  .h3-sec { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 12px 0 16px; }
  .ic { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: .85em; background: var(--grey-100); border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 5px; }
  .copy-lg { color: var(--grey-700); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 640px; }
  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  .mcp-hero { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto 48px; text-align: center; padding: 0 24px; }
  .mcp-hero h1 { font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 68px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; margin-top: 12px; }
  .mcp-hero .copy-lg { margin-top: 20px; }

  .feat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 1fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; padding: 48px 0; }
  .feat-reverse { direction: rtl; }
  .feat-reverse > * { direction: ltr; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .feat, .feat-reverse { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; direction: ltr; } }

  .code-card { border: 1px solid var(--grey-200); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--bg-dark); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg); }
  .code-card pre { margin: 0; padding: 22px; overflow-x: auto; }
  .code-card code { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--grey-100); white-space: pre; }

  .more-links { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 24px; }

  .api-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); margin-top: 30px; }
  .api-card { background: var(--bg-card); padding: 26px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .api-card .api-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
  .api-card p { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .api-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
